"    以下命令使用 Ubuntu 镜像。对于 openEuler，请将其\n"
"    `IMAGE` 值替换为\n"
"    `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-a5-openeuler`。"

msgid ""
"Run this command on every participating 950DT products server. Set\n"
