msgid ""
"This example uses DP8/TP1/EP8 on one eight-NPU server. Set `MODEL_PATH`\n"
"    to the local checkpoint path."
msgstr ""
"此示例在一台八 NPU 服务器上使用 DP8/TP1/EP8。将 `MODEL_PATH`\n"
"    设置为本地 checkpoint 路径。"

msgid ""
"- `--max-model-len 150000` limits the total input and output length of one\n"
"        request. `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` limits the tokens scheduled in one\n"
"        iteration, while `--max-num-seqs 32` limits the sequences scheduled by each\n"
"        DP engine. Increasing either scheduler limit can improve throughput but also\n"
"        increases memory usage.\n"
"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` allows up to 36,000 seconds for engine\n"
"        processes to finish initialization, including weight loading and graph\n"
"        preparation.\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1. Keep this\n"
"        value at `0` because DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash currently does not support model\n"
"        runner V2 on A2/A3.\n"
"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` keeps the\n"
"        Engram table in host memory and lets local DP ranks share the host-memory\n"
"        allocation. This is required on A3 because the model's 24 Engram heads\n"
"        cannot be evenly divided across 16 logical devices. It also reduces\n"
"        duplicate host-memory copies. The A3 container example uses `--ipc=host` so\n"
"        all four local DP ranks share the host IPC namespace.\n"
"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` captures the\n"
"        Decode path while Prefill remains outside the captured graph.\n"
"    - `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` avoids eagerly materializing the whole\n"
"        checkpoint during loading.\n"
"    - `enable_fused_mc2`, `enable_dsa_cp`, `enable_flashcomm1`, and\n"
"        `enable_shared_expert_dp` enable the A3 MoE and communication optimizations\n"
"        used by this configuration. `enable_cpu_binding` pins worker processes to\n"
"        CPUs, while `enable_npugraph_ex` enables the enhanced ACL Graph path."
msgstr ""
"- `--max-model-len 150000` 限制单个请求的总输入和输出长度。`--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 限制单次迭代调度的 token 数，而 `--max-num-seqs 32` 限制每个 DP 引擎调度的序列数。提高任一调度器限制都可以提升吞吐量，但也会增加内存占用。\n"
"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` 允许引擎进程最多 36,000 秒完成初始化，包括权重加载和计算图准备。\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 显式选择 model runner V1。请将该值保持为 `0`，因为 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 目前在 A2/A3 上不支持 model runner V2。\n"
"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` 将 Engram 表保留在主机内存中，并允许本地 DP rank 共享该主机内存分配。在 A3 上这是必需的，因为模型的 24 个 Engram head 无法在 16 个逻辑设备上均匀划分。它还能减少重复的主机内存副本。A3 容器示例使用 `--ipc=host`，以便所有四个本地 DP rank 共享主机 IPC 命名空间。\n"
"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 捕获 Decode 路径，而 Prefill 保持在捕获图之外。\n"
"    - `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` 避免在加载期间急切地将整个 checkpoint 物化到内存中。\n"
"    - `enable_fused_mc2`、`enable_dsa_cp`、`enable_flashcomm1` 和 `enable_shared_expert_dp` 启用此配置所使用的 A3 MoE 和通信优化。`enable_cpu_binding` 将 worker 进程绑定到 CPU，而 `enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL Graph 路径。"

msgid "#### 5.2.1 DP8 Prefill and DP8 Decode"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 DP8 Prefill 与 DP8 Decode"

msgid ""
"Use two eight-NPU servers for 1P1D. Both roles use DP8/TP1/EP8, with\n"
"    one API endpoint per DP rank."
msgstr "使用两台八 NPU 服务器部署 1P1D。两个角色均使用 DP8/TP1/EP8，每个 DP rank 对应一个 API 端点。"

msgid "| Role | DP / TP / EP | API ports | DP RPC port | KV handshake ports |"
msgstr "| 角色 | DP / TP / EP | API 端口 | DP RPC 端口 | KV 握手端口 |"

msgid ""
"Prefill and Decode form separate DP groups on different servers, so both\n"
"    can use RPC port `12321`. Within each group, all ranks must use the same\n"
"    coordinator IP and RPC port."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 和 Decode 在不同服务器上组成独立的 DP 组，因此两者都可以使用 RPC 端口 `12321`。在每个组内，所有 rank "
"必须使用相同的协调器 IP 和 RPC 端口。"

msgid ""
"`kv_port` is a base port; the connector adds the DP/TP/PCP rank offsets.\n"
"    Keep the same base port on every rank of the same role. The `prefill`\n"
"    and `decode` topology values must match on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"`kv_port` 是基础端口；连接器会在此基础上加上 DP/TP/PCP rank 偏移量。同一角色的每个 rank "
"必须保持相同的基础端口。两个节点上的 `prefill` 和 `decode` 拓扑值必须一致。"

msgid ""
"Basic accuracy checks have been completed on GPQA and MMMU-Pro, and PCP\n"
"    has been tested together with Memcache KV Cache Pool. Further stress\n"
"    testing and production-level validation have not been performed."
msgstr ""
"已在 GPQA 和 MMMU-Pro 上完成基础精度检查，并且 PCP 已与 Memcache KV Cache Pool "
"一起测试。尚未进行进一步的压力测试和生产级验证。"

msgid ""
"For long prompts, PCP can distribute one Prefill request across all eight\n"
"    NPUs. Starting from the DP8 Prefill template above, make these changes:"
msgstr ""
"对于长 prompt，PCP 可以将一个 Prefill 请求分配到全部八个 NPU 上。基于上述 DP8 Prefill 模板，进行以下修改："

msgid "| Setting | DP8 Prefill | PCP8 Prefill |"
msgstr "| 设置 | DP8 Prefill | PCP8 Prefill |"

msgid "    | Visible devices per process | One NPU | All eight NPUs |"
msgstr "    | 每个进程可见的设备 | 一个 NPU | 全部八个 NPU |"

msgid "    | Connector `prefill.dp_size` on both roles | 8 | 1 |"
msgstr "    | 两个角色上的连接器 `prefill.dp_size` | 8 | 1 |"

msgid ""
"Replace Prefill's `--additional-config` with the following configuration.\n"
"    Keep eager execution and `--max-num-seqs 16` unchanged."
msgstr ""
"将 Prefill 的 `--additional-config` 替换为以下配置。保持 eager 执行和 `--max-num-seqs 16` "
"不变。"

msgid "Run the modified template once with all eight visible devices:"
msgstr "使用全部八个可见设备运行一次修改后的模板："

msgid ""
"Register only Prefill port `7100` in the proxy. Decode keeps DP8 and its\n"
"    existing startup command; update its connector's `prefill.dp_size` to `1`.\n"
"    For Memcache pooling, apply the same changes to the Prefill template and\n"
"    the nested `MooncakeHybridConnector` topology on both roles, retaining\n"
"    `use_layerwise=false`. See the [Context Parallel guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md)\n"
"    for PCP details."
msgstr ""
"在代理中仅注册 Prefill 端口 `7100`。Decode 保持 DP8 及其现有启动命令；将其连接器的 `prefill.dp_size` "
"更新为 `1`。对于 Memcache 池化，对 Prefill 模板以及两个角色上嵌套的 `MooncakeHybridConnector` "
"拓扑应用相同的修改，并保留 `use_layerwise=false`。有关 PCP 的详细信息，请参阅 [Context Parallel "
"指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md)。"

msgid ""
"For higher Decode performance, evaluate a wider EP group across multiple\n"
"    Decode servers. Two eight-NPU Decode servers can form DP16/TP1/EP16 while\n"
"    Prefill remains DP8/TP1/EP8. Keep `--enable-expert-parallel` and TP1 in\n"
"    the Decode template; increasing global DP to 16 gives EP16. Retain its\n"
"    batch limits, graph mode, DSpark, and other model settings as a starting point."
msgstr ""
"为了获得更高的 Decode 性能，可以评估跨多台 Decode 服务器的更宽 EP 组。两台八 NPU 的 Decode 服务器可以组成 "
"DP16/TP1/EP16，而 Prefill 保持 DP8/TP1/EP8。在 Decode 模板中保留 `--enable-expert-"
"parallel` 和 TP1；将全局 DP 增加到 16 即可得到 EP16。保留其批处理限制、图模式、DSpark 及其他模型设置作为起点。"

msgid ""
"Set `decode.dp_size` to `16` in the connector configuration on both\n"
"    Prefill and Decode; keep `prefill.dp_size=8` and `tp_size=1`. For Memcache,\n"
"    change the same values in the nested `MooncakeHybridConnector`. Keep the\n"
"    Decode KV base port at `27010`; global DP ranks use `27010–27025`.\n"
"    Register ports `7100–7107` from each Decode server in the proxy, for 16\n"
"    Decode endpoints in total. Start both servers before waiting for readiness.\n"
"    Recheck Decode latency and throughput for the target workload before\n"
"    changing the batch limits."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 和 Decode 两端的连接器配置中将 `decode.dp_size` 设置为 `16`；保持 "
"`prefill.dp_size=8` 和 `tp_size=1` 不变。对于 Memcache，请在嵌套的 "
"`MooncakeHybridConnector` 中修改相同的值。保持 Decode KV 基础端口为 `27010`；全局 DP rank 使用 "
"`27010–27025`。在代理中注册每个 Decode 服务器的端口 `7100–7107`，共 16 个 Decode "
"端点。在等待就绪之前启动两个服务器。在更改批处理限制之前，请重新检查目标工作负载的 Decode 延迟和吞吐量。"

msgid "#### 5.2.2 A3 Deployment"
msgstr "#### 5.2.2 A3 部署"

msgid "##### 5.2.2.1 Prepare the DP Launcher"
msgstr "##### 5.2.2.1 准备 DP 启动器"

msgid "##### 5.2.2.2 Start the Prefill Node"
msgstr "##### 5.2.2.2 启动 Prefill 节点"

msgid "##### 5.2.2.3 Start the Decode Node"
msgstr "##### 5.2.2.3 启动 Decode 节点"

msgid "##### 5.2.2.4 Deploy the PD Proxy"
msgstr "##### 5.2.2.4 部署 PD 代理"

msgid "##### 5.2.2.5 Key Parameter Descriptions"
msgstr "##### 5.2.2.5 关键参数说明"

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` gives every Prefill and Decode engine up\n"
"      to 36,000 seconds to finish startup. This includes weight loading and Decode\n"
"      graph preparation.\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1 on both\n"
"      Prefill and Decode. Keep this value at `0` because DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\n"
"      currently does not support model runner V2 on Ascend.\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-size` and `--tensor-parallel-size` define DP4/TP4 on\n"
"      Prefill and DP8/TP2 on Decode. Their product must be 16 on each A3 node.\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` coordinate DP ranks\n"
"      within one role. Prefill and Decode use their respective node IPs; port\n"
"      `12321` can be reused because the roles run on different hosts.\n"
"    - `--vllm-start-port 7100` assigns API ports `7100-7103` on Prefill and\n"
"      `7100-7107` on Decode. These endpoints must be reachable by the PD proxy.\n"
"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 1048576`. Prefill uses\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` and `--max-num-seqs 16` to favor prompt\n"
"      throughput, while Decode uses `512` and `72` respectively to favor decode\n"
"      concurrency. Tune these role-specific scheduler limits independently.\n"
"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector` transfers KV cache between the two roles.\n"
"      `kv_role` must be `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer` on Decode.\n"
"      `kv_port` must be reachable and must not conflict with another service.\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` must match the actual global layouts on both\n"
"      sides: Prefill DP4/TP4 and Decode DP8/TP2. Keep the values identical in the\n"
"      Prefill and Decode commands.\n"
"    - Both roles use DSpark with five speculative tokens. Prefill runs the target\n"
"      model in eager mode. Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` for the target model,\n"
"      while `enforce_eager` inside `--speculative-config` applies to the Decode\n"
"      draft model.\n"
"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` keeps the\n"
"      Engram table in host memory and lets local DP ranks share the host-memory\n"
"      allocation. `dp_shared_memory` is required on A3 because the model's 24\n"
"      Engram heads cannot be evenly divided across 16 logical devices. Both A3\n"
"      containers use `--ipc=host` so the local DP ranks can share the allocation.\n"
"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` captures the\n"
"      Decode path while Prefill remains outside the captured graph.\n"
"    - Prefix caching is enabled only on Prefill. Decode disables it and enables\n"
"      `recompute_scheduler_enable` so Prefill can recompute unavailable KV cache.\n"
"    - Prefill uses the following `--additional-config` options:"
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=36000` 为每个 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎提供最多 36,000 秒的启动时间。这包括权重加载和 Decode 图准备。\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 在 Prefill 和 Decode 两端显式选择模型运行器 V1。请将此值保持为 `0`，因为 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 目前在昇腾上不支持模型运行器 V2。\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-size` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size` 在 Prefill 上定义 DP4/TP4，在 Decode 上定义 DP8/TP2。它们的乘积在每个 A3 节点上必须为 16。\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 协调同一角色内的 DP rank。Prefill 和 Decode 使用各自的节点 IP；端口 `12321` 可以复用，因为角色运行在不同的主机上。\n"
"    - `--vllm-start-port 7100` 在 Prefill 上分配 API 端口 `7100-7103`，在 Decode 上分配 `7100-7107`。这些端点必须能被 PD 代理访问。\n"
"    - 两个角色都使用 `--max-model-len 1048576`。Prefill 使用 `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 和 `--max-num-seqs 16` 以偏向提示吞吐量，而 Decode 分别使用 `512` 和 `72` 以偏向解码并发。请独立调整这些角色特定的调度器限制。\n"
"    - `MooncakeHybridConnector` 在两个角色之间传输 KV 缓存。`kv_role` 在 Prefill 上必须为 `kv_producer`，在 Decode 上必须为 `kv_consumer`。`kv_port` 必须可访问，且不得与其他服务冲突。\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` 必须与两端的实际全局布局匹配：Prefill DP4/TP4 和 Decode DP8/TP2。在 Prefill 和 Decode 命令中保持值一致。\n"
"    - 两个角色都使用 DSpark，带有五个推测 token。Prefill 以 eager 模式运行目标模型。Decode 对目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`，而 `--speculative-config` 中的 `enforce_eager` 适用于 Decode 草稿模型。\n"
"    - `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'` 将 Engram 表保留在主机内存中，并允许本地 DP rank 共享主机内存分配。在 A3 上需要 `dp_shared_memory`，因为模型的 24 个 Engram 头无法在 16 个逻辑设备上均匀分配。两个 A3 容器都使用 `--ipc=host`，以便本地 DP rank 可以共享分配。\n"
"    - `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 捕获 Decode 路径，而 Prefill 保持在捕获图之外。\n"
"    - 前缀缓存仅在 Prefill 上启用。Decode 禁用它并启用 `recompute_scheduler_enable`，以便 Prefill 可以重新计算不可用的 KV 缓存。\n"
"    - Prefill 使用以下 `--additional-config` 选项："

msgid "#### 5.2.3 A2 Deployment"
msgstr "#### 5.2.3 A2 部署"

msgid "##### 5.2.3.1 Prepare the DP Launcher"
msgstr "##### 5.2.3.1 准备 DP 启动器"

msgid "##### 5.2.3.2 Start the Prefill Nodes"
msgstr "##### 5.2.3.2 启动 Prefill 节点"

msgid "##### 5.2.3.3 Start the Decode Nodes"
msgstr "##### 5.2.3.3 启动 Decode 节点"

msgid "##### 5.2.3.4 Deploy the PD Proxy"
msgstr "##### 5.2.3.4 部署 PD 代理"

msgid "##### 5.2.3.5 Key Parameter Descriptions"
msgstr "##### 5.2.3.5 关键参数说明"

msgid "Select the tab for the target hardware."
msgstr "选择目标硬件对应的标签页。"

msgid "#### 5.3.1 Memcache KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "#### 5.3.1 Memcache KV 缓存池"

msgid ""
"`MultiConnector` combines `MooncakeHybridConnector` for P-to-D transfer with\n"
"    `AscendStoreConnector` for Memcache access. Prefill looks up, loads, and\n"
"    stores reusable prefixes; Decode receives KV from Prefill. DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\n"
"    uses bulk pool access: set `use_layerwise` to `false` on both roles."
msgstr ""
"`MultiConnector` 将用于 P 到 D 传输的 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 与用于 Memcache 访问的 "
"`AscendStoreConnector` 组合在一起。Prefill 查找、加载并存储可复用的前缀；Decode 从 Prefill 接收 "
"KV。DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 使用批量池访问：在两个角色上将 `use_layerwise` 设置为 `false`。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash KV Cache Pool deployment has been tested with\n"
"    Memcache only. Mooncake KV Cache Pool has not been validated for this\n"
"    model and hardware combination. `MooncakeHybridConnector` below provides\n"
"    P-to-D transfer; it does not select Mooncake as the pool backend."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash KV 缓存池部署仅使用 Memcache 进行了测试。Mooncake "
"KV 缓存池尚未针对此模型和硬件组合进行验证。下面的 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 提供 P 到 D 传输；它不会选择 "
"Mooncake 作为池后端。"

msgid "##### 5.3.1.1 Prepare Memcache"
msgstr "##### 5.3.1.1 准备 Memcache"

msgid ""
"Install `memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid` on both nodes using the\n"
"    [Memcache backend guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend).\n"
"    Use `device_urma` for Device UB, or `device_uboe` for UBOE."
msgstr ""
"使用 [Memcache "
"后端指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend) 在两个节点上安装 `memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid`。对于 Device UB 使用 "
"`device_urma`，对于 UBOE 使用 `device_uboe`。"

msgid "Create `meta.conf` on the MetaService node:"
msgstr "在 MetaService 节点上创建 `meta.conf`："

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-local.conf` on both Prefill and Decode nodes, using the same\n"
"    MetaService IP:"
msgstr "在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上创建 `mmc-local.conf`，使用相同的 MetaService IP："

msgid ""
"Each vLLM worker starts an embedded LocalService. `dram.size` is the DRAM\n"
"    contributed by each LocalService. With eight workers per node, `25GB`\n"
"    reserves about 200 GiB per node, or 400 GiB across the two servers.\n"
"    `max.dram.size` must be at least the largest `dram.size` contributed by any\n"
"    LocalService; it does not limit the total pool capacity. Adjust both values\n"
"    to the host memory available after Engram offloading and model loading.\n"
"    `world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices in the pool, not the DP\n"
"    size. No standalone LocalService is needed for this configuration."
msgstr ""
"每个 vLLM worker 都会启动一个内嵌的 LocalService。`dram.size` 是每个\n"
"    LocalService 贡献的 DRAM。每节点八个 worker 时，`25GB` 会在每节点预留约\n"
"    200 GiB，两台服务器合计约 400 GiB。`max.dram.size` 必须至少等于任一\n"
"    LocalService 贡献的最大 `dram.size`；它并不限制池的总容量。请根据 Engram\n"
"    卸载和模型加载后主机可用的内存调整这两个值。`world_size` 是池中\n"
"    LocalService 的最大数量，而不是 DP 大小。此配置无需独立的 LocalService。"

msgid "Start one MetaService before starting vLLM:"
msgstr "在启动 vLLM 之前启动一个 MetaService："

msgid ""
"Check Prefill external prefix-cache hits and MetaService DRAM get hits:"
msgstr "检查 Prefill 外部前缀缓存命中数和 MetaService DRAM get 命中数："

msgid "#### 5.3.2 Memcache KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "#### 5.3.2 Memcache KV Cache 池"

msgid ""
"DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash does not support layerwise KV Cache Pool access because its\n"
"    CED hybrid-attention model structure is incompatible with layer-by-layer KV\n"
"    save and load. Keep `use_layerwise` set to `false` on both Prefill and Decode."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 不支持逐层 KV Cache 池访问，因为其 CED 混合注意力模型\n"
"    结构与逐层 KV 保存和加载不兼容。请在 Prefill 和 Decode 上都将\n"
"    `use_layerwise` 设置为 `false`。"

msgid ""
"This example uses separated Memcache deployment so that the pool reserves host\n"
"    memory before vLLM loads the model. Prepare one MetaService configuration and\n"
"    two LocalService configurations as described below."
msgstr ""
"此示例使用分离式 Memcache 部署，以便池在 vLLM 加载模型之前预留主机内存。\n"
"    按下文所述准备一个 MetaService 配置和两个 LocalService 配置。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.1 Prepare the Memcache Services"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.1 准备 Memcache 服务"

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-local.conf` on both Prefill and Decode nodes for the LocalService\n"
"    embedded in vLLM:"
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上为 vLLM 内嵌的 LocalService 创建\n"
"    `mmc-local.conf`："

msgid ""
"Create `mmc-local-standalone.conf` on both nodes for the standalone Memcache\n"
"    process. It uses the same endpoints, world size, and protocol, but contributes\n"
"    the host DRAM used by the pool:"
msgstr ""
"在两个节点上为独立的 Memcache 进程创建 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`。\n"
"    它使用相同的端点、world size 和协议，但贡献池所使用的主机 DRAM："

msgid ""
"`world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices that can join the pool, not\n"
"    the DP size. Changing it after LocalServices connect requires restarting\n"
"    MetaService. `device_sdma` is recommended for A3 HCCS and requires LingQu\n"
"    Computing Network 1.5 or later. The `200GB` standalone DRAM value is an example;\n"
"    set it according to the host memory available after reserving capacity for the\n"
"    operating system and vLLM. `max.dram.size` must be at least the largest\n"
"    `dram.size` contributed by any LocalService."
msgstr ""
"`world_size` 是能够加入池的 LocalService 最大数量，而不是 DP 大小。\n"
"    在 LocalService 连接后更改它需要重启 MetaService。A3 HCCS 推荐使用\n"
"    `device_sdma`，它需要灵衢计算网络 1.5 或更高版本。`200GB` 的独立 DRAM 值\n"
"    仅为示例；请根据为操作系统和 vLLM 预留容量后主机可用的内存进行设置。\n"
"    `max.dram.size` 必须至少等于任一 LocalService 贡献的最大 `dram.size`。"

msgid ""
"Save the following script as `memcache_standalone.py` on both Prefill and\n"
"    Decode nodes:"
msgstr "在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上将以下脚本保存为 `memcache_standalone.py`："

msgid ""
"After MetaService is ready, start the standalone Memcache process on both\n"
"    Prefill and Decode nodes and wait for successful initialization:"
msgstr ""
"MetaService 就绪后，在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上启动独立的 Memcache 进程，\n"
"    并等待初始化成功："

msgid ""
"For additional parameters and capacity constraints, refer to\n"
"    [Memcache and vLLM separated deployment](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#Memcache-and-vLLM-Separated-Deployment)."
msgstr ""
"有关其他参数和容量限制，请参阅\n"
"    [Memcache 与 vLLM 分离部署](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#Memcache-and-vLLM-Separated-Deployment)。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.2 Start the Prefill Node with Pooling"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.2 启动带池化的 Prefill 节点"

msgid ""
"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
"    `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH`, and\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
"    `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH`、`MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 和\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.3 Start the Decode Node with Pooling"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.3 启动带池化的 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
"    `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH`, and\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
"    `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH`、`MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 和\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR`。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.4 Startup and Verification"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.4 启动与验证"

msgid ""
"Start the components in this order: Memcache MetaService, standalone Memcache\n"
"    on both Prefill and Decode nodes, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the\n"
"    PD proxy."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动各组件：Memcache MetaService、Prefill 和 Decode 节点上的独立 Memcache、Decode "
"引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。"

msgid ""
"Send the same request twice with a reusable prefix. Confirm that Prefill logs\n"
"    show Memcache lookup, get, put, and hit activity, and that Decode logs still\n"
"    show normal Prefill-to-Decode KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"使用可复用的前缀发送两次相同的请求。确认 Prefill 日志中显示 Memcache 的 lookup、get、put 和 hit 活动，并且 "
"Decode 日志仍显示正常的 Prefill 到 Decode 的 KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"- `MultiConnector` combines live P-to-D transfer through\n"
"      `MooncakeHybridConnector` with persistent prefix reuse through\n"
"      `AscendStoreConnector`.\n"
"    - `backend: \"memcache\"` selects Memcache as the KV Cache Pool backend.\n"
"    - `use_layerwise: false` is required for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash. Do not enable\n"
"      layerwise pooling for this model because its CED hybrid-attention structure\n"
"      is not supported by the layerwise path."
msgstr ""
"- `MultiConnector` 通过 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 实现实时的 P 到 D 传输，并通过 `AscendStoreConnector` 实现持久化的前缀复用。\n"
"    - `backend: \"memcache\"` 选择 Memcache 作为 KV Cache Pool 后端。\n"
"    - DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 要求 `use_layerwise: false`。请勿为此模型启用分层池化，因为其 CED 混合注意力结构不受分层路径支持。"

msgid ""
"For Memcache configuration, capacity tuning, and troubleshooting, refer to the\n"
"    [KV Cache Pool guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)."
msgstr ""
"有关 Memcache 配置、容量调优和故障排除，请参阅 [KV Cache Pool "
"指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-"
"backend)。"

msgid "Select the service endpoint for the deployment:"
msgstr "为部署选择服务端点："

msgid "| Deployment | `SERVICE_URL` | `HEALTH_PATH` |"
msgstr "| 部署 | `SERVICE_URL` | `HEALTH_PATH` |"

msgid ""
"| 950DT products or A3 single-node colocated | `http://<SERVICE_IP>:8000` | "
"`health` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend 950DT系列产品或 A3 单节点混部 | `http://<SERVICE_IP>:8000` | `health` |"

msgid ""
"| 950DT products or A3 PD proxy | `http://<PROXY_IP>:1999` | `healthcheck` |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend 950DT系列产品或 A3 PD 代理 | `http://<PROXY_IP>:1999` | `healthcheck` |"

msgid "| A2 multi-node colocated | `http://<A2_NODE0_IP>:8000` | `health` |"
msgstr "| A2 多节点混部 | `http://<A2_NODE0_IP>:8000` | `health` |"

msgid ""
"The PD proxy examples use port `1999`. If a different proxy port is configured,\n"
"use that port in `SERVICE_URL`."
msgstr "PD 代理示例使用端口 `1999`。如果配置了不同的代理端口，请在 `SERVICE_URL` 中使用该端口。"

msgid ""
"The proxy's `/healthcheck` reports the configured Prefill and Decode instance\n"
"counts; it does not verify whether those instances are ready. To check an\n"
"individual instance, send `GET /health` to its IP address and API port, for\n"
"example `http://<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:7100/health` or\n"
"`http://<DECODE_NODE_IP>:7100/health`. The backend API ports start at `7100` on\n"
"both A3 and 950DT products."
msgstr ""
"代理的 `/healthcheck` 报告已配置的 Prefill 和 Decode 实例数量；它不会验证这些实例是否就绪。要检查单个实例，请向其 IP"
" 地址和 API 端口发送 `GET /health`，例如 `http://<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:7100/health` 或 "
"`http://<DECODE_NODE_IP>:7100/health`。在 A3 和 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，后端 API 端口均从 "
"`7100` 开始。"

msgid ""
"The response must contain a model entry whose `id` is `dsv41`, matching\n"
"`--served-model-name dsv41` in the serving examples."
msgstr ""
"响应中必须包含一个 `id` 为 `dsv41` 的模型条目，与推理示例中的 `--served-model-name dsv41` 相匹配。"

msgid ""
"| Deployment / role | NPUs | DP / TP / PCP | Max sequences | Batch tokens | "
"Memory utilization | Execution |"
msgstr ""
"| 部署 / 角色 | NPU | DP / TP / PCP | 最大序列数 | 批处理 token 数 | 显存利用率 | 执行模式 |"

msgid ""
"These configurations use DSpark with five speculative tokens and Engram\n"
"host offloading. The Memcache example uses the same batch settings as\n"
"ordinary PD deployment."
msgstr ""
"这些配置使用 DSpark（五个推测 token）和 Engram 主机卸载。Memcache 示例使用与普通 PD 部署相同的批处理设置。"

msgid "### 10.1 How do I enable tool calling and reasoning parsing?"
msgstr "### 10.1 如何启用工具调用和推理解析？"

msgid ""
"- A2/A3 use model runner V1. In the A3 PD example, Prefill and the DSpark\n"
"  draft run in eager mode, while the Decode target uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`\n"
"  ACL Graph. 950DT products use model runner V2.\n"
"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash requires `use_layerwise=false` for KV Cache Pool access."
msgstr ""
"- A2/A3 使用 model runner V1。在 A3 PD 示例中，Prefill 和 DSpark draft 以 eager 模式运行，而 Decode 目标使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph。Ascend 950DT系列产品使用 model runner V2。\n"
"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 访问 KV Cache Pool 时需要 `use_layerwise=false`。"

msgid ""
"- **A3 single-node colocated**: one Atlas 800I A3 server with 8 NPUs and 128GB\n"
"  memory per NPU. The server exposes 16 logical devices to the container.\n"
"- **A3 1P1D**: two Atlas 800I A3 servers with the same device configuration.\n"
"- **A2 series**: two Atlas 800I A2 servers. Each server has 8 NPUs with 64GB\n"
"  memory per NPU and exposes 8 devices to the container.\n"
"- **A2 1P1D**: four Atlas 800I A2 servers with the same device configuration.\n"
"- **950DT products single-node colocated**: one 950DT products server\n"
"  with 8 NPUs and 96GB memory per NPU, using DP8/TP1/EP8.\n"
"- **950DT products 1P1D, with or without pooling**: two such servers, using\n"
"  DP8/TP1/EP8 on both Prefill and Decode. For optional PCP Prefill and\n"
"  wider Decode EP groups, see [Section 5.2.1.5](#5215-deployment-extensions)."
msgstr ""
"- **A3 单节点混部**：一台 Atlas 800I A3 服务器，配备 8 个 NPU，每个 NPU 128GB\n"
"  内存。该服务器向容器暴露 16 个逻辑设备。\n"
"- **A3 1P1D**：两台 Atlas 800I A3 服务器，设备配置相同。\n"
"- **A2 系列**：两台 Atlas 800I A2 服务器。每台服务器配备 8 个 NPU，每个 NPU 64GB\n"
"  内存，并向容器暴露 8 个设备。\n"
"- **A2 1P1D**：四台 Atlas 800I A2 服务器，设备配置相同。\n"
"- **Ascend 950DT系列产品单节点混部**：一台 Ascend 950DT系列产品服务器，\n"
"  配备 8 个 NPU，每个 NPU 96GB 内存，使用 DP8/TP1/EP8。\n"
"- **Ascend 950DT系列产品 1P1D（带或不带池化）**：两台此类服务器，Prefill 和 Decode\n"
"  均使用 DP8/TP1/EP8。关于可选的 PCP Prefill 和\n"
"  更宽的 Decode EP 组，请参见[第 5.2.1.5 节](#5215-deployment-extensions)。"

msgid "##### 5.2.1.1 Prepare the DP Launcher"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.1 准备 DP 启动器"

msgid "On both nodes, create a working directory inside the container:"
msgstr "在两个节点上，在容器内创建一个工作目录："

msgid ""
"Save the following script as `launch_online_dp.py` in this directory.\n"
"    Keep the node's `run_dp_template.sh` in the same directory and run the\n"
"    launcher from there. Each node needs its own role-specific template."
msgstr ""
"将以下脚本保存为该目录中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。\n"
"    将节点的 `run_dp_template.sh` 保留在同一目录中，并从该目录运行\n"
"    启动器。每个节点都需要自己的角色专属模板。"

msgid ""
"The launcher divides the local NPUs among DP ranks and starts one vLLM\n"
"    process per rank."
msgstr ""
"启动器将本地 NPU 分配给各个 DP rank，并为每个 rank 启动一个 vLLM\n"
"    进程。"

msgid "| Parameter | Description | Value in this 1P1D example |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 描述 | 本 1P1D 示例中的值 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-size` | Total DP ranks in one role's group, across all its "
"nodes. Prefill and Decode form separate groups. | `8` on both roles. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--dp-size` | 一个角色组中跨其所有节点的 DP rank 总数。Prefill 和 Decode 构成独立的组。 | "
"两个角色均为 `8`。 |"

msgid "    | `--tp-size` | Number of NPUs assigned to each DP rank. | `1`. |"
msgstr "    | `--tp-size` | 分配给每个 DP rank 的 NPU 数量。 | `1`。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-size-local` | Number of DP ranks started on the current node. | "
"`8`. |"
msgstr "    | `--dp-size-local` | 在当前节点上启动的 DP rank 数量。 | `8`。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-rank-start` | Global rank of the first DP engine on this node. |"
" `0`; local engines receive ranks `0` through `7`. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--dp-rank-start` | 当前节点上第一个 DP 引擎的全局 rank。 | `0`；本地引擎获得 rank `0` 到 "
"`7`。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-address` | DP master IP for this role's group; use the same "
"address on every node in the group. | Prefill node IP for the Prefill group;"
" Decode node IP for the Decode group. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--dp-address` | 该角色组的 DP 主节点 IP；组内每个节点都使用相同地址。 | Prefill 组使用 Prefill "
"节点 IP；Decode 组使用 Decode 节点 IP。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--dp-rpc-port` | Coordination port shared by all ranks in this role's"
" DP group. | `12321`; the two groups can use the same port on different "
"servers. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--dp-rpc-port` | 该角色 DP 组中所有 rank 共享的协调端口。 | "
"`12321`；两个组可以在不同服务器上使用相同端口。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--vllm-start-port` | API port of the first local engine, incremented "
"by one for each subsequent engine. | `7100`, giving ports `7100` through "
"`7107`. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--vllm-start-port` | 第一个本地引擎的 API 端口，后续每个引擎递增一。 | `7100`，即端口 `7100` 到"
" `7107`。 |"

msgid ""
"For multi-node DP or wide EP, set `--dp-address` to the corresponding\n"
"    group's DP master IP on every node, including worker nodes."
msgstr ""
"对于多节点 DP 或宽 EP，在每个节点（包括工作节点）上将 `--dp-address`\n"
"    设置为对应组的 DP 主节点 IP。"

msgid ""
"The launcher calls `run_dp_template.sh` with seven positional arguments:\n"
"    visible devices, API port, global DP size, global DP rank, coordinator IP,\n"
"    coordinator RPC port, and TP size. Each template below documents this order."
msgstr ""
"启动器以七个位置参数调用 `run_dp_template.sh`：\n"
"    可见设备、API 端口、全局 DP 大小、全局 DP rank、协调器 IP、\n"
"    协调器 RPC 端口和 TP 大小。下面的每个模板都记录了此顺序。"

msgid ""
"Prefill and Decode can start concurrently in separate terminals. Each\n"
"    launcher runs in the foreground; keep its terminal open."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 和 Decode 可以在不同的终端中并发启动。每个\n"
"    启动器都在前台运行；请保持其终端打开。"

msgid "##### 5.2.1.2 Start the Decode Node"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.2 启动 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"On Decode, save the following as `~/dsv41-pd/run_dp_template.sh`, beside\n"
"    `launch_online_dp.py`. Set `local_ip`, `nic_name`, and `MODEL_PATH` for the\n"
"    Decode server."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 上，将以下内容保存为 `~/dsv41-pd/run_dp_template.sh`，与\n"
"    `launch_online_dp.py` 放在一起。为 Decode 服务器设置 `local_ip`、`nic_name` 和\n"
"    `MODEL_PATH`。"

msgid ""
"In the launch command below, `$1` is a visible NPU ID from `0` to `7`,\n"
"    `$2` is its API port (`7100` through `7107`), `$3` is the global DP size\n"
"    (`8`), `$4` is the global DP rank (`0` through `7`), `$5` is the Decode\n"
"    group's coordinator IP, `$6` is its DP RPC port (`12321`), and `$7` is\n"
"    the TP size (`1`)."
msgstr ""
"在下面的启动命令中，`$1` 是可见 NPU ID，从 `0` 到 `7`，\n"
"    `$2` 是其 API 端口（`7100` 到 `7107`），`$3` 是全局 DP 大小\n"
"    （`8`），`$4` 是全局 DP rank（`0` 到 `7`），`$5` 是 Decode\n"
"    组的协调器 IP，`$6` 是其 DP RPC 端口（`12321`），`$7` 是\n"
"    TP 大小（`1`）。"

msgid "Start the eight Decode engines from their working directory:"
msgstr "从工作目录启动八个 Decode 引擎："

msgid "##### 5.2.1.3 Start the Prefill Node"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.3 启动 Prefill 节点"

msgid ""
"On Prefill, save the following as `~/dsv41-pd/run_dp_template.sh`, beside\n"
"    its own `launch_online_dp.py`. Set `local_ip`, `nic_name`, and `MODEL_PATH`\n"
"    for the Prefill server."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 上，将以下内容保存为 `~/dsv41-pd/run_dp_template.sh`，与其自身的\n"
"    `launch_online_dp.py` 放在一起。为 Prefill 服务器设置 `local_ip`、`nic_name` 和\n"
"    `MODEL_PATH`。"

msgid ""
"In the launch command below, `$1` is a visible NPU ID from `0` to `7`,\n"
"    `$2` is its API port (`7100` through `7107`), `$3` is the global DP size\n"
"    (`8`), `$4` is the global DP rank (`0` through `7`), `$5` is the Prefill\n"
"    group's coordinator IP, `$6` is its DP RPC port (`12321`), and `$7` is\n"
"    the TP size (`1`)."
msgstr ""
"在下面的启动命令中，`$1` 是可见 NPU ID，从 `0` 到 `7`，\n"
"    `$2` 是其 API 端口（`7100` 到 `7107`），`$3` 是全局 DP 大小\n"
"    （`8`），`$4` 是全局 DP rank（`0` 到 `7`），`$5` 是 Prefill\n"
"    组的协调器 IP，`$6` 是其 DP RPC 端口（`12321`），`$7` 是\n"
"    TP 大小（`1`）。"

msgid "Start the eight Prefill engines from their working directory:"
msgstr "从工作目录启动八个 Prefill 引擎："

msgid "##### 5.2.1.4 Deploy the PD Proxy"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.4 部署 PD 代理"

msgid ""
"Each Prefill and Decode engine reports `Application startup complete.` in\n"
"    its terminal when startup is complete. Once all engines are ready, start\n"
"    the proxy in a separate terminal on a node that can reach both servers,\n"
"    with all eight endpoints from each role. Use the non-layerwise\n"
"    proxy below for the Hybrid Connector configuration in this section:"
msgstr ""
"每个 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎在启动完成时会在其终端中报告\n"
"    `Application startup complete.`。所有引擎就绪后，在能够访问两台服务器的\n"
"    节点上的单独终端中启动代理，\n"
"    并包含每个角色的全部八个端点。对于本节中的 Hybrid Connector 配置，\n"
"    请使用下面的非分层代理："

msgid ""
"Verify the service using [Section 5.6](#56-service-verification), then send\n"
"    the text request in [Section 6.1](#61-text-request) to the proxy. Check the\n"
"    P/D logs for successful KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"使用[第 5.6 节](#56-service-verification)验证服务，然后向代理发送\n"
"    [第 6.1 节](#61-text-request)中的文本请求。检查\n"
"    P/D 日志以确认 KV 传输成功。"

msgid "##### 5.2.1.5 Deployment Extensions"
msgstr "##### 5.2.1.5 部署扩展"

msgid "###### 5.2.1.5.1 PCP Prefill (Experimental)"
msgstr "###### 5.2.1.5.1 PCP Prefill（实验性）"

msgid "###### 5.2.1.5.2 Decode with Wide Expert Parallelism"
msgstr "###### 5.2.1.5.2 使用宽专家并行的 Decode"

msgid ""
"Verify [cross-node communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)\n"
"    first. Set the Decode template's local IP and network interface separately\n"
"    on each Decode server. Both servers use the first Decode server's IP as\n"
"    the DP master:"
msgstr ""
"首先验证[跨节点通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)。\n"
"    在每台 Decode 服务器上分别设置 Decode 模板的本地 IP 和网络接口。\n"
"    两台服务器都使用第一台 Decode 服务器的 IP 作为\n"
"    DP 主节点："

msgid ""
"This example adds a DRAM KV Cache Pool to the two-server DP8 Prefill / DP8\n"
"    Decode deployment in [Section 5.2.1](#521-dp8-prefill-and-dp8-decode). The model layout, ports, and proxy are\n"
"    the same as ordinary PD deployment."
msgstr ""
"本示例为[第 5.2.1 节](#521-dp8-prefill-and-dp8-decode)中的双服务器 DP8 Prefill / DP8\n"
"    Decode 部署添加一个 DRAM KV Cache Pool。模型布局、端口和代理\n"
"    与普通 PD 部署相同。"

msgid ""
"On both nodes, create a separate working directory for the pooled "
"deployment:"
msgstr "在两个节点上，为池化部署创建一个单独的工作目录："

msgid ""
"Save `launch_online_dp.py` from\n"
"    [Section 5.2.1.1](#5211-prepare-the-dp-launcher) in this directory on each\n"
"    node. It uses the same arguments described there. Save the corresponding\n"
"    pooled `run_dp_template.sh` below beside it and run all launcher commands\n"
"    from this directory, because the launcher opens `./run_dp_template.sh`."
msgstr ""
"将本文档 [第 5.2.1.1 节](#5211-prepare-the-dp-launcher) 中的 `launch_online_dp.py`\n"
"    保存到每个节点的该目录下。它使用该节描述的相同参数。将下方对应的池化版\n"
"    `run_dp_template.sh` 保存到它旁边，并从该目录运行所有启动器命令，\n"
"    因为启动器会打开 `./run_dp_template.sh`。"

msgid ""
"Keep MetaService running in its terminal. After MetaService is ready,\n"
"    Prefill and Decode can start concurrently in separate terminals."
msgstr ""
"让 MetaService 在其终端中保持运行。MetaService 就绪后，\n"
"    Prefill 和 Decode 可以在各自的终端中并发启动。"

msgid "##### 5.3.1.2 Start the Decode Node with Pooling"
msgstr "##### 5.3.1.2 启动带池化的 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"On Decode, save the following as `~/dsv41-memcache/run_dp_template.sh`,\n"
"    beside `launch_online_dp.py`. Set `local_ip`, `nic_name`, and `MODEL_PATH`\n"
"    for this node. Set `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` to the `Location` reported by\n"
"    `pip show memcache_hybrid`, and `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` to the directory\n"
"    containing this node's `mmc-local.conf`."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上，将以下内容保存为 `~/dsv41-memcache/run_dp_template.sh`，\n"
"    与 `launch_online_dp.py` 放在一起。为该节点设置 `local_ip`、`nic_name` 和 `MODEL_PATH`。\n"
"    将 `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 设置为 `pip show memcache_hybrid` 报告的 `Location`，\n"
"    并将 `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 设置为包含该节点 `mmc-local.conf` 的目录。"

msgid "After MetaService is ready, start the eight Decode engines:"
msgstr "MetaService 就绪后，启动八个 Decode 引擎："

msgid "##### 5.3.1.3 Start the Prefill Node with Pooling"
msgstr "##### 5.3.1.3 启动带池化的 Prefill 节点"

msgid ""
"On Prefill, save the following as `~/dsv41-memcache/run_dp_template.sh`,\n"
"    beside its own `launch_online_dp.py`. Set this node's network, model, and\n"
"    Memcache paths as described for Decode above. Both nodes must use the same\n"
"    MetaService endpoint in `mmc-local.conf`."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下内容保存为 `~/dsv41-memcache/run_dp_template.sh`，\n"
"    与其自身的 `launch_online_dp.py` 放在一起。按照上文 Decode 节点的说明，\n"
"    设置该节点的网络、模型和 Memcache 路径。两个节点必须在 `mmc-local.conf` 中使用相同的\n"
"    MetaService 端点。"

msgid "After MetaService is ready, start the eight Prefill engines:"
msgstr "MetaService 就绪后，启动八个 Prefill 引擎："

msgid "##### 5.3.1.4 Start the Proxy and Verify Pooling"
msgstr "##### 5.3.1.4 启动代理并验证池化"

msgid ""
"Each Prefill and Decode engine reports `Application startup complete.` in\n"
"    its terminal when startup is complete. Once all engines are ready, start\n"
"    the proxy from [Section 5.2.1.4](#5214-deploy-the-pd-proxy) with the same\n"
"    endpoints. Verify the service using [Section 5.6](#56-service-verification).\n"
"    Send a long prompt to populate the pool, then reuse its prefix with a\n"
"    different suffix."
msgstr ""
"每个 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎在启动完成后都会在其终端中输出\n"
"    `Application startup complete.`。所有引擎就绪后，使用相同的端点，\n"
"    按照 [第 5.2.1.4 节](#5214-deploy-the-pd-proxy) 启动代理。\n"
"    使用 [第 5.6 节](#56-service-verification) 验证服务。\n"
"    发送一个长提示词以填充池，然后使用不同的后缀复用其前缀。"

msgid ""
"Check all Prefill ranks because the proxy may\n"
"    route requests to different ranks. Confirm that external hit tokens and\n"
"    Memcache DRAM get hits increase, and that Prefill logs show a successful\n"
"    external load. Decode external hits also include P-to-D transfer, so they\n"
"    do not identify a DRAM pool hit by themselves."
msgstr ""
"检查所有 Prefill rank，因为代理可能会\n"
"    将请求路由到不同的 rank。确认外部命中 token 数和\n"
"    Memcache DRAM 命中次数增加，并且 Prefill 日志显示外部加载成功。\n"
"    Decode 的外部命中还包含 P 到 D 的传输，因此它们本身\n"
"    并不能表明发生了 DRAM 池命中。"

msgid ""
"This configuration extends the A3 1P1D deployment in [Section 5.2.2](#522-a3-deployment) with a\n"
"    Memcache KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
"    cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
"    cache in Memcache. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
"    `MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在 [第 5.2.2 节](#522-a3-deployment) 的 A3 1P1D 部署基础上，\n"
"    增加了 Memcache KV Cache 池。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV\n"
"    缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 `AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV\n"
"    缓存存储到 Memcache 中。两个连接器都配置为\n"
"    `MultiConnector` 的子连接器。"

msgid ""
"Before starting vLLM, follow the\n"
"    [Memcache backend guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    to install `memfabric-hybrid` and `memcache-hybrid`, configure\n"
"    `meta.conf`, `mmc-local.conf`, and `mmc-local-standalone.conf`, and start the\n"
"    Memcache MetaService. The\n"
"    Prefill and Decode nodes must use the same MetaService endpoint. Keep the\n"
"    `/etc/hccn.conf` container mount from [Section 4.1](#41-docker-image-installation)."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前，请按照\n"
"    [Memcache 后端指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    安装 `memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid`，配置\n"
"    `meta.conf`、`mmc-local.conf` 和 `mmc-local-standalone.conf`，并启动\n"
"    Memcache MetaService。\n"
"    Prefill 和 Decode 节点必须使用相同的 MetaService 端点。保留\n"
"    [第 4.1 节](#41-docker-image-installation) 中的 `/etc/hccn.conf` 容器挂载。"

msgid ""
"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from [Section 5.2.2.1](#5221-prepare-the-dp-launcher). Set `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` to\n"
"    the `Location` reported by `pip show memcache_hybrid`, and set\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` to the absolute directory containing the configuration\n"
"    files above on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"复用 [第 5.2.2.1 节](#5221-prepare-the-dp-launcher) 中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。将 `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 设置为\n"
"    `pip show memcache_hybrid` 报告的 `Location`，并将\n"
"    `MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 设置为两个节点上包含上述配置文件的绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"Start the four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines with the launcher command from "
"[Section 5.2.2.2](#5222-start-the-prefill-node) after all Decode engines are"
" ready."
msgstr ""
"在所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 [第 5.2.2.2 节](#5222-start-the-prefill-node) 中的启动器命令启动四个 "
"DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。"

msgid ""
"Start the eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines with the launcher command from [Section\n"
"    5.2.2.3](#5223-start-the-decode-node)."
msgstr ""
"使用 [第 5.2.2.3 节](#5223-start-the-decode-node) 中的启动器命令\n"
"    启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。"

msgid ""
"Wait until both standalone Memcache processes report successful initialization\n"
"    before starting the Decode engines. Then wait until every Decode engine reports\n"
"    `Application startup complete` before starting Prefill. After every Prefill engine is ready, start the proxy with the\n"
"    same endpoint mapping described in [Section 5.2.2.4](#5224-deploy-the-pd-proxy)."
msgstr ""
"在启动 Decode 引擎之前，等待两个独立的 Memcache 进程都报告初始化成功。\n"
"    然后等待每个 Decode 引擎都报告\n"
"    `Application startup complete`，再启动 Prefill。所有 Prefill 引擎就绪后，\n"
"    使用 [第 5.2.2.4 节](#5224-deploy-the-pd-proxy) 中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"

msgid ""
"This configuration extends the A2 1P1D deployment in [Section 5.2.3](#523-a2-deployment) with a\n"
"Mooncake KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
"cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
"cache in Mooncake. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
"`MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在 [第 5.2.3 节](#523-a2-deployment) 的 A2 1P1D 部署基础上，\n"
"增加了 Mooncake KV Cache 池。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV\n"
"缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 `AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV\n"
"缓存存储到 Mooncake 中。两个连接器都配置为\n"
"`MultiConnector` 的子连接器。"

msgid ""
"Start the four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines with the launcher command from "
"[Section 5.2.3.2](#5232-start-the-prefill-nodes) after all Decode engines "
"are ready."
msgstr ""
"在所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 [第 5.2.3.2 节](#5232-start-the-prefill-nodes) 中的启动器命令启动四个"
" DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。"

msgid ""
"Start the eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines with the launcher command from "
"[Section 5.2.3.3](#5233-start-the-decode-nodes)."
msgstr ""
"使用 [第 5.2.3.3 节](#5233-start-the-decode-nodes) 中的启动器命令启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode "
"引擎。"

msgid ""
"Start the components in this order: Mooncake Master Service, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the PD proxy. The Mooncake Store clients are embedded in the vLLM processes; no standalone Store process is required for this configuration.\n"
"Wait until the Mooncake master process reports successful initialization before starting the Decode engines and the Prefill engines. After every Prefill engine and every Decode engine is ready, start the proxy with the same endpoint mapping described in [Section 5.2.3.4](#5234-deploy-the-pd-proxy)."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动各组件：Mooncake Master Service、Decode 引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。Mooncake Store 客户端内嵌在 vLLM 进程中；此配置不需要独立的 Store 进程。\n"
"在启动 Decode 引擎和 Prefill 引擎之前，等待 Mooncake master 进程报告初始化成功。所有 Prefill 引擎和所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 [第 5.2.3.4 节](#5234-deploy-the-pd-proxy) 中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"

msgid ""
"The following example checks a colocated service. For PD, use the proxy URL\n"
"and `healthcheck` from the table instead. Reuse `SERVICE_URL` for the requests\n"
"in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"以下示例检查共置服务。对于 PD，请改用表中的代理 URL\n"
"和 `healthcheck`。在 [第 6 节](#6-functional-verification) 的请求中\n"
"复用 `SERVICE_URL`。"

msgid ""
"Use `SERVICE_URL` from [Section 5.6](#56-service-verification). To set\n"
"reasoning effort to an integer from 1 to 100, pass it through\n"
"`chat_template_kwargs.reasoning_effort`. The following example uses `50`."
msgstr ""
"使用 [第 5.6 节](#56-service-verification) 中的 `SERVICE_URL`。要将\n"
"推理强度设置为 1 到 100 之间的整数，请通过\n"
"`chat_template_kwargs.reasoning_effort` 传入。以下示例使用 `50`。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: the service returns `HTTP 200` and a JSON response with\n"
"the answer `2` in `choices[0].message.content`. With the reasoning parser\n"
"enabled, `choices[0].message.reasoning` contains the reasoning text."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：服务返回 `HTTP 200`，并在 `choices[0].message.content` 中返回包含答案 `2` 的 JSON "
"响应。启用推理解析器后，`choices[0].message.reasoning` 中包含推理文本。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: the service returns `HTTP 200` and describes the supplied\n"
"image in `choices[0].message.content`. Check that the description matches\n"
"the image, including its main objects or scene."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：服务返回 `HTTP 200`，并在 `choices[0].message.content` "
"中描述所提供的图像。请检查描述是否与图像相符，包括其主要对象或场景。"

msgid "### 9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "### 9.1 推荐配置"

msgid ""
"[Section 5.1](#51-single-node-colocated-deployment) and\n"
"[Section 5.2](#52-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment) provide the recommended\n"
"performance configurations for the hardware and deployment modes covered\n"
"by this guide. Use the corresponding startup commands to reproduce these\n"
"configurations."
msgstr ""
"[第 5.1 节](#51-single-node-colocated-deployment)和\n"
"[第 5.2 节](#52-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment)提供了本指南所涵盖的硬件和部署模式下的推荐性能配置。请使用相应的启动命令来复现这些配置。"

msgid ""
"Keep DP4/TP4 for A3 single-node deployment,\n"
"or Prefill DP4/TP4 and Decode DP8/TP2 for A3 PD deployment, until an\n"
"alternative configuration has been validated."
msgstr ""
"在替代配置经过验证之前，A3 单节点部署请保持 DP4/TP4，A3 PD 部署请保持 Prefill DP4/TP4 和 Decode "
"DP8/TP2。"

msgid ""
"The 950DT products configurations are summarized below. `max-num-seqs` and\n"
"`max-num-batched-tokens` apply per DP engine. The recommended 1P1D layout\n"
"uses eight DP ranks on each node; PCP and wider Decode EP groups are optional\n"
"extensions in [Section 5.2.1.5](#5215-deployment-extensions)."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品的配置总结如下。`max-num-seqs` 和\n"
"`max-num-batched-tokens` 按每个 DP engine 生效。推荐的 1P1D 布局在每个节点上使用八个 DP rank；PCP 和更宽的 Decode EP 组是[第 5.2.1.5 节](#5215-deployment-extensions)中的可选扩展。"

msgid "### 9.2 Workload-Specific Tuning"
msgstr "### 9.2 针对特定工作负载的调优"

msgid ""
"When the workload changes, evaluate configurations with the tools in\n"
"[Section 8](#8-performance-evaluation). Keep input and output lengths,\n"
"image sizes, prefix cache hit rate, reasoning effort, and request\n"
"concurrency the same when comparing results. Measure time to first token,\n"
"time per output token, throughput, and NPU memory usage against the\n"
"service's latency and capacity requirements."
msgstr ""
"当工作负载发生变化时，请使用[第 8 节](#8-performance-"
"evaluation)中的工具评估配置。在比较结果时，请保持输入和输出长度、图像尺寸、前缀缓存命中率、推理力度和请求并发数一致。请测量首 token "
"时延、每输出 token 时延、吞吐量和 NPU 内存使用量，并与服务的时延和容量要求进行对比。"

msgid ""
"For 950DT products, [Section 5.2.1.5](#5215-deployment-extensions) describes\n"
"wider Decode EP groups for workloads that require higher Decode performance\n"
"and experimental PCP Prefill for long prompts. For workloads with repeated\n"
"prefixes, keep Prefill local prefix caching enabled and verify its actual hit\n"
"rate. To reuse prefixes across ranks or servers, evaluate the\n"
"[Memcache KV Cache Pool](#53-1p1d-deployment-with-memcache-kv-cache-pool).\n"
"The pooling verification example disables local caching to expose external\n"
"pool hits; this is separate from the ordinary PD performance configuration."
msgstr ""
"对于 Ascend 950DT系列产品，[第 5.2.1.5 节](#5215-deployment-extensions)描述了适用于需要更高 Decode 性能的工作负载的更宽 Decode EP 组，以及针对长提示词的实验性 PCP Prefill。对于具有重复前缀的工作负载，请保持 Prefill 本地前缀缓存启用，并验证其实际命中率。如需跨 rank 或服务器复用前缀，请评估\n"
"[Memcache KV Cache Pool](#53-1p1d-deployment-with-memcache-kv-cache-pool)。\n"
"池化验证示例会禁用本地缓存以暴露外部池命中；这与常规的 PD 性能配置不同。"

msgid ""
"For general tuning methods, refer to the\n"
"[Performance Tuning guide](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关通用调优方法，请参阅\n"
"[性能调优指南](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。"
